1.
Shrimant Chintamanrao Appasaheb Patwardhan was the first Ruler of the Sangli State.
He constructed a temple in Sangli city and installed his family idol therein.
The first Ruler became the sole trustee of the Trust.
On 25/11/1940, the Sangli Ganpati Panchayat Sansthan Act, 1940, (for short, ' the Act of 1940') came into force.
